INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('obra/superpowers/test-driven-development', 'test-driven-development', 'obra', 'superpowers', 'official', 'test-driven-development obra superpowers official Test-driven development is a process for implementing features and bug fixes by writing tests first. It benefits developers by ensuring code quality and reliability. El Desarrollo Dirigido por Pruebas (TDD) es una técnica de desarrollo de software que implica escribir pruebas antes de implementar el código. Esto ayuda a garantizar la calidad y reducir errores Le Développement Piloté par les Tests (TDD) est une technique de développement logiciel qui consiste à écrire des tests avant de mettre en œuvre le code. Cela aide à garantir la qualité et à réduire les erreurs Die testgetriebene Entwicklung (TDD) ist eine Software-Entwicklungstechnik, bei der Tests vor der Implementierung des Codes geschrieben werden. Dies hilft, die Qualität zu gewährleisten und Fehler zu reduzieren O desenvolvimento dirigido por testes (TDD) é uma prática de codificação que envolve escrever testes antes de escrever o código de implementação. Test-Driven Development (TDD) - это методология программирования, при которой сначала пишутся тесты, а затем код реализации. التطوير الموجه بالاختبار (TDD) هو منهجية برمجة تتضمن كتابة الاختبارات قبل كتابة رمز التنفيذ. how to use test-driven development what is test-driven development test-driven development best practices test-driven development vs behavior-driven development test-driven development setup guide test-driven development for AI agents implementing test-driven development for new features test-driven development for bug fixes and refactoring Writes tests before implementation code Ensures code quality through repetitive test cycles Supports new features, bug fixes, and refactoring Requires minimal code to pass tests Validates test effectiveness by watching tests fail Excludes throwaway prototypes and generated code from TDD Test-driven development is a software development process that relies on the repetitive cycle of writing tests before writing implementation code.');
